Package: datagoodr
Type: Package
Title: Document and Profile Research Datasets
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Olivia", "Beck", email = "obeck@urban.org", role = "aut"),
    person("Jesse", "Lecy", email = "jlecy@urban.org", role = c("aut", "cre")))
Description: Tools for documenting and profiling research datasets. datagoodr
    generates a Data Governance File (DGF) that captures the minimum metadata,
    summary statistics, and graphics needed to describe a dataset, then renders
    a formatted Research Guide (RG) report from that file. Gooder data means
    gooder research.
